DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Let's get together and practice our Tar
 ot cards and pendulums.**\n**This is for beginners through advanced reader
 s to practice their skills.**\n\n**Everyone will get to do a reading. Ther
 e will be extra decks and pendulums if you do not have some. We will try d
 ifferent layouts and share our experiences. All fun!**\n\n**We will have a
 n introduction to tarot discussion for the first 20 minutes then most of t
 he time will be just practice\, so come on by.**\n\n**See you there!**\n**
 Shaman Phil**
