SUMMARY:11/1 Manifestation Portal
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nHave you ever wondered what is the differ
 ence between manifesting and magnatism?\nWhat about how shadow work plays 
 a role in the alchemy of it all?\n\nOn 11/1 we will be gathering at the So
 ul Sanctuary for a Samhain manifestion portal ritual. Join us as we explor
 e the rich history of Samhain. As well as\, guide the group through the fu
 ll manifestation process. So we all can embody that which we are calling f
 orth in our life.\n\n**About your guides**\n***Jenn (She/Her)*** is an int
 uitive healer trained Yoga Teacher 9+ years\, Reiki Master\, Astrologer an
 d Spiritual Coach. She combines her knowledge of the body from 13 years wo
 rking in physical therapy with all spiritual tools that have contributed t
 o her own healing & spiritual journey to help guide others.\n***Vi (They/T
 hem)*** is a practicing Witch & Psychic who is a trained Yoga Teacher\, Re
 iki Master\, and Tarot Reader. They combine their passions of astrology\, 
 divination\, dance\, and creative expression to help others listen to thei
 r intuition.\n\nDonation suggestion: $25-$35\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** Pre-regis
 tration is required for this event to honor the capacity of the space. If 
 you would like to skip the fees\, you can email sensefulwellness@gmail.com
  and just let us know you are planning on attending.
