SUMMARY:Raw Cacao\, Sweet Remembrance: Honoring Our Untamable Soul
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**We have a few spots left for this uniqu
 e cacao ceremony to honor YOU! Get your tickets at** [www.starsounds.love]
 (https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/raw-cacao-sweet-remembrance-hon
 oring-our-untamable-soul)\n\nEvery version of you that ever existed surviv
 ed so that the current you could be here today. Yet\, we rarely pause to h
 onor the chapters we've outgrown\, the dreams we've laid to rest\, or the 
 younger selves who carried us through the dark. In alignment with the veil
 -thinning energy of November 1st\, we invite you to a unique\, sacred cere
 mony dedicated to the archaeology of your own soul. Together\, we will hon
 or our personal history\, offering deep gratitude\, grief\, and celerabtio
 n for the versions of self that have supported our evolution.\n\n**The Cos
 mic Alignment**\nWe gather under a potent\, confrontational sky designed t
 o reveal your raw\, authentic truth. This All Soul’s Day features a Gran
 d Trine between the Moon\, Saturn\, and Black Moon Lilith\, bringing ances
 tral healing and shadow work into the energetic field. Guided by the Scorp
 io Sun\, Third Quarter Moon in Leo\, Saturn Retrograde\, and Pluto in Aqua
 rius\, we will step into our future entirely unburdened.\n\n**The Sacred M
 odalities**\n\n* **Ceremonial Cacao:** A warm\, heart-opening elixir to gr
 ound the nervous system and safely open the emotional body.\n* **Shadow Di
 alogue & Radical Remembrance:** A guided practice to speak directly to the
  parts of your history you were told were "too much" or cast out\, invitin
 g them back into your heart.\n* **Plutonian Sound Integration:** A deeply 
 restorative sound bath featuring immersive crystal frequencies and resonan
 t low tones to wash away residual grief and anchor your rebirth.\n\n**Logi
 stics & Registration**\n\n* **Date:** Sunday\, November 1st\n* **Location:
 ** Quietude\n* **Cost:** Sliding scale donation from $33 to $55.\n* **Atte
 ndance:** Walk-ins are welcome on a first-come\, first-served basis if spo
 ts remain.\n\n**What to Bring**\n\n* A photograph of a loved one or a past
  version of yourself\, an old journal\, or a small token representing a li
 fe chapter you are ready to integrate.\n* A journal and pen.\n* A water bo
 ttle.\n* Comfortable clothing for sitting and lying down.\n\n**About Your 
 Guides**\n\n* **David Heiss:** An Evolutionary Astrologer\, Sound Alchemis
 t\, and Sacred Ceremony Facilitator who blends gongs\, crystal bowls\, and
  mystical instruments to cultivate conditions for healing and restoration.
 \n* **Michelle:** An avid SoulCollage® Creatrix\, intuitive facilitator\,
  and lifelong educator who works with individuals' HighSelves to nurture i
 nner wisdom and self-reflection.
