SUMMARY:Reiki Chakra Tune Up
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for a 25-minute Reiki distance he
 aling session to ground\, clear\, and protect your energy through tuning y
 our chakras.\nReiki involves channeling healing energy through the practit
 ioner’s hands to promote physical\, emotional\, and spiritual wellbeing 
 in the recipient.\nI will help channel universal life force energy (Reiki)
  through time and space for you to create space for deep relaxation and he
 aling.\nIf you are having any negative feelings or just want to relax\, th
 en this Chakra cleansing meditation is for you. This session will help you
  clear blockages and release any attachments that do not serve your higher
  purpose. This healing meditation will leave you feeling peaceful\, relaxe
 d\, and more yourself.\nThis guided meditation helps to release negative e
 nergy within the body and surrounding aura. As you go through this meditat
 ion\, allow yourself to remain open and in alignment with the universal en
 ergy that is being sent to you.\nThe session may include music\, vibration
 s\, and guided practices to enhance the energy flow.\nI hope to see you th
 ere!\n\nShaman Phil
