SUMMARY:Try it out Day at Spirited Improv
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWhether you've never set foot in a Spirit
 ed Improv circle or you've been coming home to us for years\, I want to le
 t you know about something new. A single playshop\, just two hours\, where
  you can feel the magic for yourself or simply enjoy it again with fresh e
 yes.\n\nWhat if one day could remind you what it feels like to be fully hu
 man\, together?\n\n**What is Spirited Improv "Try it out" Playshop?**\nA 2
 -hour playshop of movement\, music\, story\, and unscripted connection. No
  script\, no performance pressure\, no experience needed. Just a circle of
  people willing to show up\, play\, and see what unfolds when a room lets 
 go of the need to get it right.\n\n**When?**\nNov 3rd\, 12:00-2 pm in Mont
 ford\n\n**Who it's for**\nPeople craving real connection\, creative expres
 sion\, and a little more Love in their lives. If you're drawn to personal 
 growth\, spiritual community\, or simply want an evening that feels differ
 ent from the ones that came before it\, this is for you.\n\n**Led by**\nJe
 ssica Chilton\, an expressive arts practitioner and TEDx performer with tw
 enty years in improvisational performing arts. She holds space with warmth
  and a deep trust in whatever wants to emerge in the room.\n\n**What peopl
 e are saying**\n"It's like free-falling into the unknown\, but with a big\
 , warm\, and fluffy safety net that hugs you when you land."\n"We're just 
 taking off all our stuff and walking out in our essence."\nCome see for yo
 urself.\n\nRegister at [https://www.spiritedimprov.com/offers/6yz8AC3z/che
 ckout](https://www.spiritedimprov.com/offers/6yz8AC3z/checkout)
